Modding Permission
------------------
WorldForge supports community-created modifications ("mods").

Users are allowed to create, distribute, and publish mods that:

- Extend or modify gameplay
- Add content such as items, races, maps, or scripts
- Integrate with the official modding systems

Mods must NOT:

- Include or redistribute original game assets
- Include proprietary source code from the game
- Circumvent DRM or licensing systems
- Be sold commercially without explicit written permission

Mods must require an official copy of WorldForge to function.

Mod creators retain ownership of the original content they
create within their mods.

